# Project Rules for AI-krasota

## General
- Always refer to docs/PRD.md for business requirements
- Follow the monorepo structure defined in README.md
- Use TypeScript for all frontend code
- Use Python type hints for all backend code

## Code Style
- Frontend: Next.js App Router, Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion
- Backend: FastAPI, Pydantic, SQLAlchemy
- Database: PostgreSQL with Row-Level Security for multi-tenancy

## Multi-tenancy
- Every table must have tenant_id field (except platform-level tables)
- Always filter queries by tenant_id
- Use Row-Level Security policies

## Mobile-First
- All UI components must work on mobile (320px+)
- Touch targets minimum 44x44px
- Test on mobile viewport before committing

## Security
- Never commit .env files
- Use environment variables for secrets
- Implement proper authentication and authorization
